tes surface tension, allowing insects to walk on water) and to other surfaces (**adhesion**—which helps water travel up the roots of giant trees).\n\n---\n\n### 3. The Ecological Perspective (Where is it found?)\nEarth is often called the **\"Blue Planet\"** because water covers about **71%** of its surface. \n* **Oceans:** About "
